              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi abo bakazi baagira bati: Obu twabaire twoterera omugabekazi w'omu iguru obubaane, tukamushukira empongano z'eby'okunywa, noogira ngu tukaba tumukorera otukeeki tumuramya, tumushukira empongano z'eby'okunya, abashaija baitu batarikubisiima?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
