          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Yeremia yaagaruka yaagambira abantu boona n'abakazi boona ati: Imwe Bayuda 'mwe mwena abari omu nsi ya Misri, nimuhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Imwe n'abakazi baanyu mukeegambira n'endimi zaanyu, mwabihikiiriza n'emikono yaanyu, nimugira muti: Tituribura kuhikiiriza ebi twagambire nituhiga, kwoterera omugabekazi w'omu iguru obubaane, n'okumushukira empongano z'eby'okunywa. Mpaho nimwirooko mugumizemu n'okuhiga kwanyu, kandi mukuhikiirize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 22:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.20.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 20:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka imwe Bayuda 'mwe mwena abatwire omu nsi ya Misri, muhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. Reeba, ndahiire eiziina ryangye erikuru, ku eiziina ryangye ritarigaruka kurahirwa muntu wa Yuda weena ori omu nsi ya Misri naagira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA ohuriire; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
